        "original_id": "ea8cafb0-d456-5cbf-9f43-2b4b1dd6fdd0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dick Bremer, Bert Blyleven, Jack Morris, Roy Smalley III, Torii Hunter, Michael Cuddyer, LaTroy Hawkins, Scott Ullger, Steve Liddle\n- Organizations: Minnesota Twins, Detroit Tigers, Major League Baseball\n- Roles: television broadcasters, starting pitcher, bench coach\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Morris was born on May 16, 1955.\n- Jack Morris is an American former professional baseball starting pitcher.\n- Jack Morris played in Major League Baseball from 1977 to 1994, mainly for the Detroit Tigers, and won 254 career games.\n- Steve Liddle served as the Minnesota Twins' bench coach from 2002 to 2010 before swapping roles with Scott Ullger.\n- For Minnesota Twins television broadcasts, Dick Bremer works home games with Bert Blyleven.\n- For Minnesota Twins television broadcasts, Dick Bremer works road games with Jack Morris, Roy Smalley III, Torii Hunter, Michael Cuddyer, or LaTroy Hawkins.\n- Scott Ullger was frequently called \"Scotty\" by Minnesota Twins fans and by broadcasters Bert Blyleven and Dick Bremer.",
